flowchart LR
    C1[Web / Mobile / Partner Apps]
    C2[Internal Services]
    C3[External Repos]

    APIGW[API Gateway / Edge]

    US[user-service]
    OS[organization-service]
    DS[device-service]
    OTH[Other Domain Services]

    CORE["@your-org/fhir-core\n- canonical -> FHIR adapters\n- mapping engine\n- bundle builder\n- OperationOutcome\n- validation contracts\n- terminology helpers"]
    AWS["@your-org/fhir-aws\n- Lambda / API Gateway middleware\n- auth extraction\n- raw FHIR response writer"]
    PROF["@your-org/fhir-profiles\n- base mappings\n- tenant/client overrides\n- profiles / config"]

    DB1[(User DB)]
    DB2[(Org DB)]
    DB3[(Device DB)]
    DB4[(Other DBs)]

    C1 --> APIGW
    C2 --> APIGW
    APIGW --> US
    APIGW --> OS
    APIGW --> DS
    APIGW --> OTH

    US --> DB1
    OS --> DB2
    DS --> DB3
    OTH --> DB4

    US -. consumes .-> CORE
    US -. consumes .-> AWS
    US -. consumes .-> PROF

    OS -. consumes .-> CORE
    OS -. consumes .-> AWS
    OS -. consumes .-> PROF

    DS -. consumes .-> CORE
    DS -. consumes .-> AWS
    DS -. consumes .-> PROF

    OTH -. consumes .-> CORE
    OTH -. consumes .-> AWS
    OTH -. consumes .-> PROF

    C3 -. npm install .-> CORE
    C3 -. npm install .-> AWS
    C3 -. npm install .-> PROF
